36
00:02:09,230 --> 00:02:15,230
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Man Who</font>

37
00:02:09,230 --> 00:02:15,230
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Calls Up</font>

38
00:02:09,230 --> 00:02:15,230
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">a Storm!!</font>

39
00:02:09,230 --> 00:02:15,230
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Sasuke's Fuzzy Eyebrow</font>

40
00:02:09,230 --> 00:02:15,230
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Style Combat Move!</font>

41
00:02:25,910 --> 00:02:28,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey Guy! You too, Lee-kun...</font>

42
00:02:29,210 --> 00:02:30,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is your body all right?</font>

43
00:02:31,830 --> 00:02:32,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi!</font>

44
00:02:33,210 --> 00:02:34,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

45
00:02:37,670 --> 00:02:39,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Sorry, sorry.</font>

46
00:02:40,430 --> 00:02:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must've been worried.
Sorry for not contacting you at all...</font>

47
00:02:47,430 --> 00:02:50,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no, Sakura's gonna get really mad...</font>

48
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:56,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't really mind that.</font>

49
00:03:14,790 --> 00:03:17,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's hard to see from here...</font>

50
00:03:19,340 --> 00:03:20,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

51
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei...</font>

52
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:27,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm?</font>

53
00:03:28,980 --> 00:03:32,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know about the mark
on Sasuke-kun's neck, don't you?</font>

54
00:03:35,570 --> 00:03:36,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that...?</font>

55
00:03:39,990 --> 00:03:41,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No need to worry.</font>

56
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A mark?</font>

57
00:03:52,710 --> 00:03:54,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, that's that.</font>

58
00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup!</font>

59
00:04:06,050 --> 00:04:06,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One...</font>

60
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two...</font>

61
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:10,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three...</font>

62
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Four...</font>

63
00:04:12,810 --> 00:04:13,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Five...</font>

64
00:04:14,900 --> 00:04:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Six...</font>

65
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seven...</font>

66
00:04:18,110 --> 00:04:18,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eight.</font>

67
00:04:19,610 --> 00:04:20,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eight of them...</font>

68
00:04:21,780 --> 00:04:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are eight members of
ANBU Black Ops in this spacious arena...</font>

69
00:04:24,610 --> 00:04:26,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two platoons are too few...</font>

70
00:04:27,740 --> 00:04:29,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's Hokage-sama thinking?</font>

71
00:04:30,370 --> 00:04:33,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... without knowing how or when
the opponent would make their move...</font>

72
00:04:34,330 --> 00:04:37,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped that the ANBU
are dispersed and deployed</font>

73
00:04:37,540 --> 00:04:39,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in important areas in the village.</font>

74
00:04:40,170 --> 00:04:40,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

75
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:42,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about to begin.</font>

76
00:04:43,090 --> 00:04:45,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We shouldn't let our guard down,
but for now...</font>

77
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:48,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We need to pay attention...
to this match.</font>

78
00:04:52,730 --> 00:04:58,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi, I'll be carefully checking out
what sort of training you gave him...</font>

79
00:04:59,650 --> 00:05:01,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as your eternal rival!</font>

80
00:05:04,610 --> 00:05:06,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Did you say something?</font>

81
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:12,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! You're slick, Kakashi!</font>

82
00:05:12,250 --> 00:05:15,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you always so avant-garde?!</font>

83
00:05:24,420 --> 00:05:26,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both of you, to the middle!</font>

84
00:06:26,940 --> 00:06:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Begin!</font>

85
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is the sand
Kakashi told me about...</font>

86
00:06:49,130 --> 00:06:52,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't get so mad...</font>

87
00:06:57,430 --> 00:06:58,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother...</font>

88
00:07:01,150 --> 00:07:03,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's he talking about...?</font>

89
00:07:05,230 --> 00:07:10,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earlier... Earlier I had you suck
awful-tasting blood.</font>

90
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:13,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry.</font>

91
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:19,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this time it'll likely...</font>

92
00:07:19,870 --> 00:07:21,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">taste good.</font>

93
00:07:23,790 --> 00:07:28,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His conversation's started.
This is dangerous.</font>

94
00:07:28,510 --> 00:07:32,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the first time I've seen Gaara
get like that before fighting.</font>

95
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:35,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it must mean his opponent
is that imposing...</font>

96
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:37,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Him.</font>

97
00:07:46,900 --> 00:07:49,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears he's calmed down.</font>

98
00:07:56,700 --> 00:07:57,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on.</font>

99
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:07,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

100
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:14,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you remember...
what he said yesterday?</font>

101
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:20,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time...</font>

102
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:34,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will kill... you all without fail.</font>

103
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:37,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just wait.</font>

104
00:08:38,330 --> 00:08:39,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what he said...</font>

105
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:43,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he didn't do it.</font>

106
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:47,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was the perfect opportunity, but...</font>

107
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he didn't even see us.</font>

108
00:08:57,680 --> 00:09:00,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, let me feel it!</font>

109
00:09:02,020 --> 00:09:03,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're...</font>

110
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:06,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">unsatisfactory for him.</font>

111
00:09:07,190 --> 00:09:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now, the only one who
can make him feel anything...</font>

112
00:09:11,530 --> 00:09:13,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...is only Sasuke!</font>

113
00:09:15,450 --> 00:09:19,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I live fighting for only myself
and loving myself...</font>

114
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:23,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if I see that all other people
in this world</font>

115
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:25,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">exist only to make me realize that,</font>

116
00:09:26,290 --> 00:09:29,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there could be no world more wonderful.</font>

117
00:09:32,760 --> 00:09:33,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

118
00:09:54,990 --> 00:09:55,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we go!</font>

119
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sand Shield became
a Sand Clone!</font>

120
00:10:39,410 --> 00:10:41,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's fast! This guy...
is just like that guy...</font>

121
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:15,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's fast! It's nearly the same
as Lee's ordinary speed.</font>

122
00:11:15,690 --> 00:11:16,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

123
00:11:17,230 --> 00:11:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's overlapping with the image...</font>

124
00:11:20,570 --> 00:11:21,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of my Taijutsu!</font>

125
00:11:26,330 --> 00:11:28,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that the Sand Armor?</font>

126
00:11:32,250 --> 00:11:32,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on!</font>

127
00:11:44,430 --> 00:11:46,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you, ANBU man.</font>

128
00:11:47,810 --> 00:11:51,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So apparently, Hinata will be
all right for now if she rests.</font>

129
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:55,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, is that right?</font>

130
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:03,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? You know this person?
What're you taking about?</font>

131
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This person is an ANBU...</font>

132
00:12:08,290 --> 00:12:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not that, but at the examination...?
What do you mean?</font>

133
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:21,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, this is what it means...</font>

134
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:54,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on!</font>

135
00:13:01,260 --> 00:13:03,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're not gonna come at me,
I'll go at you!</font>

136
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:10,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's fast!</font>

137
00:13:21,900 --> 00:13:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter? Is that it?</font>

138
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:32,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-Amazing...</font>

139
00:13:37,250 --> 00:13:40,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That armor... I'll tear it off.</font>

140
00:13:50,350 --> 00:13:54,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His speed is basically the same
as Lee's with the weights removed.</font>

141
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:58,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's... It's exactly like
Lee-san's Taijutsu.</font>

142
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:01,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His speed is also completely
different from before!</font>

143
00:14:12,330 --> 00:14:16,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... You are indeed
a genius beyond imagination.</font>

144
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How many years did it take me
to attain that speed...?</font>

145
00:14:23,130 --> 00:14:26,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you attained it in a mere month...!</font>

146
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:41,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, it seems to consume
a lot of stamina</font>

147
00:14:41,690 --> 00:14:43,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to continue that movement.</font>

148
00:14:46,490 --> 00:14:48,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's Gaara planning to do?</font>

149
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:51,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sand armor uses up too
much Chakra...</font>

150
00:14:52,160 --> 00:14:54,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't last for very long.</font>

151
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:07,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell sort of training
did you do?!</font>

152
00:15:07,670 --> 00:15:08,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm?</font>

153
00:15:08,970 --> 00:15:11,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To get to that level in a mere month...</font>

154
00:15:13,100 --> 00:15:16,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke had copied Lee-kun's Taijutsu
with Sharingan.</font>

155
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:20,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So during the Taijutsu training...</font>

156
00:15:20,810 --> 00:15:23,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had Sasuke image Lee-kun's movements.</font>

157
00:15:28,780 --> 00:15:31,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke could make
that movement his own</font>

158
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:33,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only because he knew Lee-kun.</font>

159
00:15:34,660 --> 00:15:37,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, Sasuke had to
work very hard for it.</font>

160
00:15:38,950 --> 00:15:41,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... with only that...</font>

161
00:15:42,250 --> 00:15:45,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With only Taijutsu...
that Sand guy can't be taken down!</font>

162
00:15:49,470 --> 00:15:50,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Kakashi...</font>

163
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:52,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He must have seen the battle</font>

164
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:55,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">between the hateful Gaara
and the lovable Lee.</font>

165
00:16:02,190 --> 00:16:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Taijutsu that was taught suddenly</font>

166
00:16:04,690 --> 00:16:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">can't work against an opponent
that even Lee couldn't take down.</font>

167
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:09,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He should have known this only to well.</font>

168
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So if that's the case...</font>

169
00:16:13,490 --> 00:16:17,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it that he had Sasuke
master only Taijutsu?!</font>

170
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:53,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did I keep living?</font>

171
00:16:55,740 --> 00:16:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But as long as you're alive,
you need a reason...</font>

172
00:16:59,540 --> 00:17:02,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't have one,
it's just the same as being dead.</font>

173
00:17:03,370 --> 00:17:05,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this guy saying?!</font>

174
00:17:09,590 --> 00:17:12,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is the answer I came to...</font>

175
00:17:12,590 --> 00:17:16,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am living in order to kill
human beings other than myself.</font>

176
00:17:17,090 --> 00:17:20,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After living in the fear of never knowing
when I might be murdered,</font>

177
00:17:20,810 --> 00:17:22,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">finally, I became calm.</font>

178
00:17:25,850 --> 00:17:26,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh?</font>

179
00:17:27,270 --> 00:17:28,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru...</font>

180
00:17:30,190 --> 00:17:32,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We need to go over to where
Kakashi-sensei is right now!</font>

181
00:17:33,940 --> 00:17:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you planning to do?</font>

182
00:17:35,860 --> 00:17:36,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

183
00:17:38,740 --> 00:17:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to...</font>

184
00:17:40,950 --> 00:17:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">stop this match!</font>

185
00:17:45,290 --> 00:17:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara couldn't possibly be planning
to use that Jutsu!</font>

186
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:35,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he used all the sand for protection...</font>

187
00:18:36,800 --> 00:18:38,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think there could be this
much of a difference in the hardness</font>

188
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:40,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with a difference in the density
of the sand.</font>

189
00:18:46,730 --> 00:18:49,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's absolute protection.</font>

190
00:18:53,940 --> 00:18:56,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sand...
It's covered his entire body.</font>

191
00:18:57,650 --> 00:18:59,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is somewhat troublesome.</font>

192
00:19:00,660 --> 00:19:02,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, how will Sasuke proceed?!</font>

193
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:07,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

194
00:19:11,630 --> 00:19:12,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun!</font>

195
00:19:19,340 --> 00:19:21,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What do you want?</font>

196
00:19:22,260 --> 00:19:25,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!
Please stop this match right away!</font>

197
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:32,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy is totally different from us!</font>

198
00:19:32,730 --> 00:19:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not normal!</font>

199
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:39,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...
What're you saying?</font>

200
00:19:39,900 --> 00:19:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He lives to kill people.</font>

201
00:19:42,860 --> 00:19:43,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case...</font>

202
00:19:44,370 --> 00:19:47,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this continues, Sasuke will die!</font>

203
00:19:48,250 --> 00:19:49,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jin, Saru,</font>

204
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:53,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ne, Saru, Tori, Tatsu, Ne, Saru...</font>

205
00:20:05,510 --> 00:20:08,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake about it.
It's that Jutsu!</font>

206
00:20:10,020 --> 00:20:14,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't good!
Our plan isn't even on Gaara's mind.</font>

207
00:20:15,730 --> 00:20:16,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

208
00:20:17,520 --> 00:20:18,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

209
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

210
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

211
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

212
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

213
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

214
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

215
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

216
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

217
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

218
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

219
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

220
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

221
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

222
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

223
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

224
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

225
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

226
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

227
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kanashimi mo kaze ni kaete tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

228
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">transform sadness into the wind and continue to forge on</font></font></font></font>

229
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

230
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">forge on strong</font></font></font></font>

231
00:22:47,630 --> 00:22:51,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Sasuke-kun, when I fought you once, I said</font>

232
00:22:51,510 --> 00:22:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Even if one understands visually,</font>

233
00:22:53,010 --> 00:22:55,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">it's meaningless unless one
can move physically.</font>

234
00:22:55,060 --> 00:22:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I was filled with
a sense of superiority.</font>

235
00:22:56,850 --> 00:23:00,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But now, you have a body that moves
at the same high speed as mine.</font>

236
00:23:00,940 --> 00:23:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Moreover, you have... Sharingan!</font>

237
00:23:03,650 --> 00:23:08,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"I wasn't Late For Nothing! Ultimate Move - Chidori Revealed!!"</font>

238
00:23:08,700 --> 00:23:11,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I am really envious of you, Sasuke-kun!</font>

